time that you're  going to spend getting to staying there  coming back from the salon over and over  and over again number 11 is to subscribe  or use the apps to the grocery stores  that you frequently shop at and i kind  of cringe because i know i normally  would say unsubscribe from everything  but i have been subscribed to two  different grocery stores that we shop  out routinely and they send me coupons  all the time i recently received a  coupon for 16 off a purchase of 160 on  groceries and with the prices of  groceries i was like yes thank you for  us this has worked really well because  sometimes you will have items on the app  that will give you different sales that  are not really visible in the store and  otherwise you wouldn't know and you  would just pay the higher price tag for  and number 12 if you struggle with  impulse shopping remove any stored cards  from any accounts log out and delete the  apps most of the online shopping that i  tend to do tends to come from amazon and  or target but initially when i was  really trying to get rid of my crazy  shopping habits what i did was i removed  all of the cards from the accounts i  deleted the apps on my phone and that  way it just kind of made another barrier  so that it forced me to really think  about the item that i was going to buy  instead of just immediately click  buy now because it can be so easy to  purchase on impulse when you just have  it so easily accessible so this kind of  creates like a barrier to help you with  those impulse purchases and as the bonus  the best money saving tip that i can  give to you is to think of money as time  because if you think about it every day  that you go to work you're working for  what for money and especially if you  have a job that you hate this can be  very motivating because the more you  think about it that item that you're  gonna buy that you really don't need how  many hours of your time do you have to  work to be able to get that thing and if  you hate your job this will very much  motivate you to save money but i'm sure  that there are certain things that you  would love to be able to do but your job  keeps you from doing those things that  you want to do maybe you have a project  that you want to start or you just want  to spend more time with your family  every time that you spend money on  something that you really don't need  you're having to work more in order to  get it but really what i would love for  you to take away from this is any  purchase that you're going to make  consider how much time does it take for  me to work to be able to get this item  and is it worth it so that is it those  are my 12  13 different ways that i plan to save  money in the new year in 2023 if you  have any money saving tips of your own  please share them in the comments down  below so that we can all learn from each  other i thank you so much for watching i  hope that you have found this video  helpful if so please give it a thumbs up  and subscribe so that you won't miss  when i post a new video i can't wait to  hear from you in the comments and i will  see you in the next one bye for now

